## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Armor Crash (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Blade Armor, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Blade Armor
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Firmness, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into low-control physical drafts when the first collision must survive marksman retaliation.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic damage that keeps hitting after the crash instead of one burst combo.; Oracle over Athena's Shield when Use when your passive shield and allied sustain decide whether you live through the second rotation.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use before the final item slot when repeated drives and resets matter more than one revive.
- Total cost: 11060 gold

Default roam setup that turns Johnson's Physical Defense scaling into crash damage, shield value, and front-line punishment.

### Roam Pickoff Dire Hit (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Thunder Belt, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Thunder Belt
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when control chains catch you after impact and Rapid Boots loses too much value.; Conceal over Dire Hit when Use when the team needs hidden lane entries more than the extra damage Johnson brings out of the crash.; Antique Cuirass over Athena's Shield when Use when physical skill burst is the main threat and magic damage is not deciding fights.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use into Chang'e, Valir, Kimmy, or other repeated magic hits that extend beyond the first impact.
- Total cost: 10760 gold

Fast-rotation pickoff setup for games built around one delivered passenger and chain control. Force banked while rotating is still loaded when the car lands, so Impact Wrench or the first Basic Attack after impact spends it.

### EXP Thunder Armor (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Thunder Belt, Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Firmness, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use against magic lane pressure or control-heavy teams where CC reduction beats early armor stacking.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when physical skill damage, not magic poke or shielding value, is what forces you out of lane.; Blade Armor over Oracle when Use when the enemy marksman is the late-game carry and must basic attack through your front line.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against one-shot magic burst that can remove you before Electro Airbag and Flicker buy time.
- Total cost: 10440 gold

EXP variant for games with another primary roamer, farming Thunder Belt stacks and wave control before joining car engages.

